Create a sci-fi movie poster showing an abandoned space station floating above a dark alien planet. Use sharp geometric lines from the station and curved organic lines from the planet to guide the viewer toward a lone astronaut. Use large circular and rectangular shapes with plenty of negative space to create a lonely mood. Give the station a smooth metallic texture and the planet a rough rocky texture, with the objects appearing massive and three-dimensional. Use strong contrast between bright white light and deep blue-black shadows to make the astronaut the main focal point.
